  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ahjqOjf.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bvjfSgy.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UAXmnMd.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W9JLdRn.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Hellim Projects - Hellim 的發光材質包<br></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此資源包為合適的方塊和生物提供動態或非動態的發光效果。我們也計劃將此效果添加到更多內容中。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">❗此資源包需要 Optifine 或搭配 Indium 模組的 Sodium。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Optifine</span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Sodium</span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Indium</span></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kFVbwEX.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">所有礦石</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wboPPVn.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">溺屍</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">終界使者</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">發光魷魚</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">鐵魔像</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">蜘蛛</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">监守者</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">❗您可以建議我們為資源包添加的<span style=\"color:#f00\">方塊或生物</span>。為此，請加入我們的 <span style=\"color:#0cf\"><a style=\"color:#0cf\" href=\"https://discord.gg/fUMVA8GKwd\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> 伺服器或留下評論。❗</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L9r1AOf.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/fUMVA8GKwd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1137725181285105735?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label= &labelColor=af0000&color=ff0000&cacheSeconds=5&link=https://discord.gg/fUMVA8GKwd\" width=\"152\" height=\"30\"></a></p>",
